  "VERDICT": "REFUTED",
  "why": "45.8% of fills are above 0.50 and 16.2% are above 0.80, with p99 at 0.97. A cap at 0.48-0.50 would have to reject nearly half the corpus. The sub-0.50 MEAN is real; a CAP is not what produces it.",
